  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">此模組讓您可以伸出手，來回撫摸朋友的頭。</span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-ladder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player Ladder</a> 相容時，將優先觸發 Headpats 功能。</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">Headpats 是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fheadpat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Headpat a Friend</a> 的移植版本。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f2be4026-ad8a-487a-86cd-6c9e0f2a34d9.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"608\" height=\"746\"></span></p>",
